            "review_title": "Review at Breezes Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Khoa\nNha Trang, Vietnam3 contributions\n0\nA Cozy Place to Eat, Relax, and Enjoy\nMay 2025 • Friends\nI recently visited this restaurant for dinner, and it was a truly enjoyable experience. The place offers a beautiful view and a refreshing atmosphere that makes dining there extra special. The staff were friendly, attentive, and made us feel very welcome throughout the evening. I was especially impressed by Tâm, who took great care of us with warm and thoughtful service.\n\nThe food was delicious, with a variety of dishes that I believe would suit many different tastes – even those of more selective diners. Each dish was well-prepared, flavorful, and nicely presented.\n\nI would definitely recommend this restaurant for both romantic dates and family gatherings. Its cozy yet elegant vibe makes it a great choice for any occasion.\nRead more\nWritten May 27, 2025",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-03",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
